Metal GL_EXT_sRGB_write_control support for chromium/8127.
Apply after the preceding patches in build.sh.

Use cached linear views to disable sRGB render-target conversion without copies.
Memoryless MSAA attachments use a cached linear transient texture instead of
a view, restoring contents from the resolve texture when the pass restarts.
Preserve load/store restrictions on texture views. Include regression tests
for toggling, clears, blending, blits, explicit and implicit MSAA, mixed
attachments, and the sRGB default framebuffer.

